---
import { profile } from "@/lib/profile";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section
  id="inicio"
  class="relative flex min-h-[85svh] items-center pt-20 pb-14 md:pt-24 md:pb-20"
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border/80 bg-surface/80 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-accent">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
      <span>Arquitectura de Software &amp; Sistemas ERP</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-sans leading-[1.08]">
      Christian Fernández
      <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-muted mt-2 font-mono">
        Desarrollador Full-Stack &amp; Consultor Técnico
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted font-sans">
      Más de 6 años construyendo y modernizando sistemas ERP en producción, donde la consistencia de inventario, facturación y reportes contables críticos no admiten margen de error.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase text-white dark:text-neutral-950 transition-all hover:bg-accent-strong focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent"
      >
        <span>Iniciar Conversación</span>
        <Icon name="arrow-up-right" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="#proyectos"
        class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-6 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-foreground transition-all hover:border-accent hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent"
      >
        <span>Explorar Proyectos</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href={profile.cvUrl}
        download
        class="inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-surface/50 px-5 text-xs font-mono text-muted transition-all hover:border-foreground hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent"
      >
        <Icon name="download" />
        <span>Descargar CV</span>
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <a
          href={profile.social.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Perfil de GitHub"
          class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border bg-surface/50 text-muted transition-all hover:border-accent hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent"
        >
          <Icon name="github" />
        </a>
        <a
          href={profile.social.linkedin}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Perfil de LinkedIn"
          class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border bg-surface/50 text-muted transition-all hover:border-accent hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent"
        >
          <Icon name="linkedin" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface/60 backdrop-blur-xs font-mono text-xs shadow-xs">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 divide-y divide-border sm:grid-cols-2 sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-surface">
          <span class="text-subtle block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Trayectoria</span>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground my-1">6+ AÑOS</div>
          <p class="text-muted text-[11px] font-sans">Sistemas ERP empresariales y plataformas en producción.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-surface">
          <span class="text-subtle block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Optimización SQL</span>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent my-1">PENSANÓMICA</div>
          <p class="text-muted text-[11px] font-sans">Reportes contables críticos optimizados de ~3h a 1.4s.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-surface">
          <span class="text-subtle block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Arquitectura</span>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground my-1">DDD &amp; HEX</div>
          <p class="text-muted text-[11px] font-sans">Aislamiento de reglas de negocio, desacoplamiento y testing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-surface">
          <span class="text-subtle block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Migración Frontend</span>
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 my-1">0% DOWNTIME</div>
          <p class="text-muted text-[11px] font-sans">Migración de portal de compras desde Vue hacia React 18.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
